n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(\\sqrt{5})^{2}}+{y}^{2}=1.\n$$\n\nSo, the curve $C$ is an ellipse centered at $O$ with horizontal and vertical semiaxes of $\\sqrt{5}$ and $1,$ respectively. Therefore, it can be parametrized as \n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,\\,0\\le t\\le \\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖,$ we get following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)j \\\\  & =-\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,i+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2}+(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5{sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4{sin}^{2}⁡t+({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=8xy\\sqrt{1+4{y}^{2}}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =8\\cdot \\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\cdot \\sqrt{1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t}=8\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\sqrt{1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}8xy\\sqrt{1+4{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}8\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\sqrt{1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t}\\cdot \\sqrt{1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t}\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{5}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t(1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this using the substitution $u=1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t,$ $\\text{d}u=8\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8\\sqrt{5}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t(1+4{sin}^{2}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\sqrt{5}{\\int }_{1}^{5}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{u}^{2}{|}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}({5}^{2}-{1}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}(25-1) \\\\  & =12\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335250 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335251 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335252 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335253 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335254 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1041 "selection" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1104 #edb/ref 17592186335254 13194139535170 true] [17592186335249 1110 #uuid "e711804e-1358-50e9-8d2f-56b62f5ebef1" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335250 1034 "12" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335250 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335250 1111 #uuid "3c2ee34b-cb77-5931-9f08-a43f2129124c" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335251 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335251 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335251 1111 #uuid "acef585d-939b-5cff-9f31-c1a740a93ed6" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335252 1034 "\\sqrt{5}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335252 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335252 1111 #uuid "8fd1a98e-e372-5645-bc65-16a9e57bb1dd" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335253 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335253 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335253 1111 #uuid "d750e38d-3877-5583-9a10-87d2c301a7f8" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335254 1034 "12\\sqrt{5}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335254 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335254 1111 #uuid "dab4cdb5-d816-5082-8e38-0096dcbf2e38" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335255 1017 #edb/ref 17592186335256 131941395