{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nSo, the curve $C$ is an ellipse centered at $O$ with horizontal and vertical semiaxes of $3$ and $\\sqrt{3},$ respectively. Therefore, it can be parametrized as \n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,\\,0\\le t\\le 2\\pi .\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖,$ we get following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)j \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,i+\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2}+(\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9{sin}^{2}⁡t+3{cos}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6{sin}^{2}⁡t+3({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=xy(3+2{y}^{2})$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot \\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\cdot (3+2(\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2})=3\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,(3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}xy(3+2{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }3\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t(3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t)\\cdot \\sqrt{3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t}\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t{(3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t)}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this using the substitution $u=3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t,$ $\\text{d}u=12\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t{(3+6{sin}^{2}⁡t)}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}{\\int }_{3}^{3}{u}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\cdot \\frac{2}{5}{u}^{5/2}{|}_{3}^{3} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335271 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335272 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335273 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335274 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335275 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1041 "selection" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1104 #edb/ref 17592186335274 13194139535170 true] [17592186335270 1110 #uuid "7f73b2a7-37e1-5db3-9dd3-5ee2dba574dd" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335271 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335271 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335271 1111 #uuid "809245f3-e504-5203-a8cd-a5e2eacc5a87" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335272 1034 "3\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335272 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335272 1111 #uuid "c23ec94a-8606-5a1b-9cb0-e1c47dd38b45" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335273 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335273 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335273 1111 #uuid "24eb9efb-7323-50ba-a5ed-ab3e17befe3e" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335274 1034 "0" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335274 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335274 1111 #uuid "4ecf58f6-ac91-57f9-8d68-86ab237014b5" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335275 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{10}" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335275 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535170 true] [17592186335275 1111 #uuid "051ab59a-8fb9-5f84-a41f-feb0cdee58f2" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335276 1017 #edb/ref 17592186335277 13194139535170 true] [17592186335276 1089 "q-123281" 13194139535170 true] [17592186335276 1091 #edb/r